==Bundles==
99 Stone are required for the {{Bundle|Construction||y}}.

==Tailoring==
Stone is used in the spool of the [[2 Willow Lane#Sewing Machine|Sewing Machine]] to create the [[File:Shirt029.png|24px]] [[Tailoring|Work Shirt]].

==Quests==
*Robin may ask the player to mine 1000 pieces of stone within one week in the [[Quests#Robin's Resource Rush|"Robin's Resource Rush"]] special order. The player may keep the harvested stone. If completed on time, Robin will mail the farmer the recipe to create a [[Stone Chest]].

==Tip==
*One method of gathering large quantities of stone is repeatedly entering and exiting the 1st level of [[the Mines]] and only breaking [[boulder]]s and silver rocks.

==History==
{{History|1.3.27|Increased price of stone at [[Carpenter's Shop]] from {{Price|20}} to {{Price|100}} in Year 2+. Added [[Stone Sign]] and [[Garden Pot]] recipes.}}
{{History|1.4|Used as a building material to the [[Fish Pond]] and as an ingredient to the [[Tree Fertilizer]] and [[Brick Floor]] recipes. Can now be used in [[Tailoring]]. Can be produced by Fish Ponds.}}
{{History|1.5|Can now be used as decoration in [[Fish Tank]]s. Used as an ingredient to the [[Bone Mill]], [[Deluxe Retaining Soil]], [[Stone Walkway Floor]], [[Geode Crusher]], [[Stone Chest]], and [[Thorns Ring]] recipes.}}
{{History|1.6|Used as an ingredient to [[Big Stone Chest]], [[Statue Of Blessings]], and [[Heavy Furnace]] recipes. Can now be purchased at [[Desert Festival]]. No longer used for building Stone Cabin. Can now be gifted by a [[Animals#Pets|pet]] dog with max [[Animals#Friendship|friendship]].}}

